{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an immersive walking simulator focused on relaxation and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dreamlike world filled with elements of poolcore, bloomcore, and various dreamcore aesthetics, where you can wander freely from a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> 30\u201360 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022\u00a0Immersive Experience</strong><br>Stroll through sunlit, plant-filled dreamlike scenes and let the soothing visuals comfort your senses. No objectives, no pressure\u2014 just peaceful exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, you may step into space with a slightly eerie atmosphere, but don\u2019t worry\u2014there are no monsters, no jump scares, and nothing that will disturb your peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608050/extras/2dd29a646d0fee77c69283cdb08a4d55.avif?t=1760780117\" width=600 height=271 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022\u00a0Interaction &amp; Play</strong><br>Interact with floaties drifting in the pool, and feel the gentle ripples of the water; You can also take a thrilling ride down giant slides above the clouds or even across the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608050/extras/c7b94788bcaf3509dc8e5de3e3289a92.poster.avif?t=1760780117\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608050/extras/c7b94788bcaf3509dc8e5de3e3289a92.webm?t=1760780117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022\u00a0Collectibles</strong><br>Many hidden rubber ducks are scattered throughout the scenes. If you ever feel like adding a little fun to your walk, try seeking them out. Some might just bring you a delightful surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608050/extras/8fab710dee889339d9010043629a315d.poster.avif?t=1760780117\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608050/extras/8fab710dee889339d9010043629a315d.webm?t=1760780117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608050/extras/8fab710dee889339d9010043629a315d.mp4?t=1760780117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608050?t=1760780117","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608050?t=1760780117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608050/ac8f641545f39536703ed81f3bdcca4066f674bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760780117","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608050/ac8f641545f39536703ed81f3bdcca4066f674bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760780117","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an immersive walking simulator focused on relaxation and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dreamlike world filled with elements of poolcore, bloomcore, and various dreamcore aesthetics, where you can wander freely from a fir